DOCUMENTATION:
    PURPOSE: LSST SIMLIB with short observing seasons, for SIMLIB_MINSEASON
    INTENT:  Test only — values are synthetic and not from any real OpSim
    USAGE_KEY: SIMLIB_FILE
    USAGE_CODE: snlc_sim.exe
    NOTES:
        Derived from JAX_TEST_LSST.SIMLIB. LIBID 0 keeps its 920 d season
        and gains a 9 d one 140 d later; LIBID 1 has only two 9 d seasons.
        With SIMLIB_MINSEASON: 30 the short seasons drop out of the season
        bookkeeping while their epochs and both LIBIDs remain.
DOCUMENTATION_END:


